<PropertySetDef>
  <IfcVersion version="2.x" schema="IfcProductExtension"/>
  <Name>Pset_OpeningElementCommon</Name>
  <Definition>Definition from IAI: Properties common to the definition of all generic opening types 'Recess' of IfcOpeningElement.</Definition>
  <Typed>True</Typed>
  <TypedClass>IfcOpeningElement</TypedClass>
  <TypeName></TypeName>
  <PropertyDefs>
    <PropertyDef id="34">
      <Name>Description</Name>
      <PropertyType>
        <TypePropertySingleValue>
          <DataType type="IfcString"/>
        </TypePropertySingleValue>
      </PropertyType>
      <ValueDef>
        <MinValue value="see type"/>
        <MaxValue value="see type"/>
        <DefaultValue value="empty string"/>
      </ValueDef>
      <Definition>
Description of this opening.
      </Definition>
    </PropertyDef>

    <PropertyDef id="863">
      <Name>ParallelJambs</Name>
      <PropertyType>
        <TypePropertySingleValue>
          <DataType type="IfcBoolean"/>
        </TypePropertySingleValue>
      </PropertyType>
      <ValueDef>
        <MinValue value="False"/>
        <MaxValue value="True"/>
        <DefaultValue value="True"/>
      </ValueDef>
      <Definition>
Indicated, whether the jambs of an opening in a curved building element are intended to be parallel (TRUE) or are radial (FALSE). Radial means, that the extension of the jambs are rays through the axis of the revolution
forming the curved building element.
      </Definition>
    </PropertyDef>

  </PropertyDefs>
</PropertySetDef>